E.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">/lo/-拉普拉斯运动会？是哪个人提的建议<br />0001 匿名 No.8972387 ▶<br />运动会哎，到底谁会参加？是平时的工作量还不够饱和吗？<br />跑200米都能要了我的命<br /><br />0002 匿名 No.5642471 ▶<br />会有人去的吧？毕竟参加了这个就可以光明正大地翘工去训练了<br />田径比较累的话，可以参加拳击类项目嘛，只要不把同事打死就行<br /><br />0003 匿名 No.8972387 ▶&gt;&gt;5642471<br />有点难<br /><br />0004 匿名 No.9851762<br />49276D20636F6D696E67</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"303602\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303604.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a2/Belonging-303604.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">竞赛级负重护具<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Protection Measures</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />50<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>采用时下最前沿的实验材料打造，通过加装金属嵌片与铆钉满足负重需要，面向专业人士的竞赛级护具。但考虑到受访者拥有的强健军人体魄，她似乎并不执著于护具的选择。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303605.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/aa/Belonging-303605.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\"><div class=\"line-1\">桌面计算机\n</div><div class=\"line-2\">牛津街印象款</div><div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">IDM5100 Oxford Street Edition</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />571.1<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>进行过更新升级的开发者原型机，基于受访者的意愿，作为负重物被带到了竞速赛场。外壳上的牛津街贴纸是赛事主办方免费派发的纪念品。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303606.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f3/Belonging-303606.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">三色电源线组<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Tricolor Cable Set</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />1.3<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>为IDM5100供电的橡皮塑料三色软电源线组，是受访者专为本次行程准备的订制品。当被问及为户外竞技作如此安排的理由时，我们依然只能从受访者口中得到一段难以解读的字符串作为回答。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><spa